# What Vercel must not upload. Same idea as .gitignore, but for the deploy:
# everything listed here stays in the repo and never reaches the CDN.
#
# Two reasons something is on this list.
#
# Weight. photos/ is 65 MB of full-resolution archival masters that no page
# ever links to — visitors are served the WebP derivatives in assets/g/, which
# is the only image directory the site references. Shipping the masters would
# more than double every deploy for files nobody fetches.
#
# Not the public's business. The markdown in this repo is the shop's working
# notes, and OPEN-QUESTIONS.md in particular discusses an unresolved consent
# question about identifiable photographs. It has no reason to sit at a
# guessable URL on the shop's own domain. netlify.toml and _redirects carry a
# redirect for the same files, because Netlify and Cloudflare Pages have no
# equivalent of this file.

photos/
tests/
tools/
playwright.config.js
package.json
package-lock.json
AUDIT.md
LICENSES.md
OPEN-QUESTIONS.md
README.md
node_modules/
test-results/
playwright-report/
